OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly outbreaks of heavy and
OL,6,Fthundery rain will soon clear east. It
OL,7,Fwill then stay largely cloudy with
OL,8,Fbright intervals and scattered
OL,9,Fshowers. Occasional low cloud and haar.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA little brightness to start
OL,12,Fthe evening, otherwise mainly cloudy
OL,13,Fwith a few showers. Some clear spells
OL,14,Flater across Orkney.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA rather cool and cloudy day
OL,17,Fwith further showers moving across
OL,18,Ffrom the west. Best of the sunny
OL,19,Fspells across Orkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
