OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and scattered showers on Sunday
OL,7,Fthen mainly dry on Monday. Showers or
OL,8,Flonger spells of rain on Tuesday.
OL,9,FLight winds.
